// Title: Local File Read Using Curl.EXE
// Sigma ID: aa6f6ea6-0676-40dd-b510-6e46f02d8867
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-07-27 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: execution
// Description: Detects execution of "curl.exe" with the "file://" protocol handler in order to read local
//   files.
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://curl.se/docs/manpage.html
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/ccbb0369507f796db0b0ae6854c8a2be471b9d84/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_curl_local_file_read.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where (FolderPath endswith "\\curl.exe" or ProcessVersionInfoOriginalFileName =~ "curl.exe") and ProcessCommandLine contains "file:///"
